WEBVTT

00:10:57.432 --> 00:11:00.013
in a two-room apartment
in the middle of nowhere

00:11:00.013 --> 00:11:02.401
where we have no bicycle, no car,

00:11:02.401 --> 00:11:04.570
no TV I can understand,

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:07.123
and I still have to support my loved ones

00:11:07.123 --> 00:11:09.654
as a travel writer and a journalist,

00:11:09.654 --> 00:11:13.018
so clearly this is not ideal
for job advancement

00:11:13.018 --> 00:11:14.845
or for cultural excitement

00:11:14.845 --> 00:11:17.212
or for social diversion.

00:11:17.212 --> 00:11:21.740
But I realized that it gives me
what I prize most,

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.040
which is days

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.773
and hours.

00:11:25.773 --> 00:11:28.400
I have never once had to use
a cell phone there.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.943
I almost never have to look at the time,